      "text": [
        " اللَّهِ عَزَّ وَ جَلَّ وَ مَنْ يُرِدْ فِيهِ بِإِلْحادٍ بِظُلْمٍ فَقَالَ مَنْ عَبَدَ فِيهِ غَيْرَ اللَّهِ عَزَّ وَ جَلَّ أَوْ تَوَلَّى فِيهِ غَيْرَ أَوْلِيَاءِ اللَّهِ فَهُوَ مُلْحِدٌ بِظُلْمٍ وَ عَلَى اللَّهِ تَبَارَكَ وَ تَعَالَى أَنْ يُذِيقَهُ مِنْ عَذَابٍ أَلِيمٍ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "<a id=\"_Toc492473665\">H 14980</a> – Ibn Mahboub, from Abu Walladin, and someone else from our companions, who have reported the following:",
          "<span class=\"first-chapter-phrase\"><span class=\"first-in-chapter character-a\">A</span>bu Abdullah</span><sup>asws</sup> regarding the Statement of Allah<sup>azwj</sup> Mighty and Majestic: <span class=\"ibTxt\">“<a href=\"/#/books/quran:22#h25\"><a href=\"/books/quran:22#h25\">[22:25]</a></a> and whoever shall incline therein to wrong unjustly, We will make him taste of a painful chastisement”</span>, so he<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘The one who worships other than Allah<sup>azwj</sup> Mighty and Majestic, or befriends other than the Guardians<sup>asws</sup> from Allah<sup>azwj</sup>, so he has inclined to injustice and it is upon Allah<sup>azwj</sup> Blessed and High to <span class=\"ibTxt\">make him taste of a painful chastisement”</span>."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "534. Ibn Mahboub, from Abu Ja’far Al-Howl, from Sallam Bin Al-Mustaneer, who has reported the following: Abu Ja’far (a.s.) regarding the Statement of Allah (azwj) Blessed and High: “<a href=\"/#/books/quran:22#h40\"><a href=\"/books/quran:22#h40\">[22:40]</a></a> Those who have been expelled from their homes without a just cause except that they say: Our Lord is Allah”. He (a.s.) said: ‘It was Revealed regarding the Rasool Allah (saww), and Ali (a.s.), and Hamza (ar), and Ja’far (ar), and it flowed regarding Al-Husayn (a.s.), may Peace be upon all of them’."
        ]
      }
    },
